    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A holy radiance clings to the steel, lingering like the memory of a righteous deed. This blade cut through the shadows of Helm's Deep, banishing the foulest sorcery with every strike. It sits in the hand with a purposeful, commanding weight."
